<h2>Set of List View Item Tiles</h2>

<p>
  To use a set of List Layout Item Tiles in a layout, you can use the
  <code>layout-grid</code> component with the specific responsive display rules
  per specifications. This will ensure proper spacing of Item Tiles in relation
  to each other and maintain the horizontally-oriented Item Tiles stacked across
  all breakpoints until it hits the <code>xl</code> breakpoint, where it
  displays two Item Tiles per row.
